<view class="page"><text class="eyebrow">ACADEMIC RECORD</text><view class="row"><view class="title">成绩</view><text class="badge">只读查询</text></view>
<view class="subtitle">查看学校已发布的课程成绩</view>
<view wx:if="{{!logged}}" class="card row"><view><view class="heading">连接学校账号</view><view class="small">使用与课表相同的登录状态</view></view><text class="link" bindtap="login">登录 ›</text></view>
<button class="primary" bindtap="refresh" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}">{{loaded ? '刷新成绩' : '查询我的成绩'}}</button><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view>
<view wx:if="{{loaded}}"><view class="card"><picker range="{{terms}}" value="{{termIndex}}" bindchange="chooseTerm"><view class="row"><text class="heading">{{terms[termIndex]}}</text><text class="link">切换学期 ⌄</text></view></picker><input class="search" placeholder="搜索课程名称或课程代码" value="{{keyword}}" bindinput="search"/><view class="small">{{shown.length}} 条记录 · 查询于 {{updated}}</view></view>
<view wx:if="{{!shown.length}}" class="empty">{{grades.length ? '没有符合条件的课程' : '学校暂未返回已发布成绩'}}</view>
<view wx:for="{{shown}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="row"><view class="course"><view class="heading">{{item.name}}</view><view class="attempts" wx:if="{{item.attempts.length}}"><text class="attempt" wx:for="{{item.attempts}}" wx:for-item="attempt" wx:key="*this">{{attempt}}</text></view><view class="small">{{item.term}}</view></view><view class="score">{{item.score}}</view></view><view class="divider"/><view class="row small"><text>学分 {{item.credits}}</text><text>绩点 {{item.gp}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.status}}">{{item.status}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{item.code}}" class="small">{{item.code}}</view></view></view>
<view wx:else class="empty">点击查询后显示成绩。</view><view class="small">仅展示学校返回的数据，不自行换算绩点。补考、重修仅在学校明确提供标记时突出显示，不按分数或同名课程推断。成绩不写入本地缓存，离开页面后清空。数据以学校正式成绩单为准。</view></view>
